  "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>'SAKSHAM' </strong>- An Awareness program on Energy Conservation conducted by CICC and Women Cell of ATMECE in Association with Indian Oil Corporation on 08-05-2023 at the college premises. Hundreds of students participated and Resource Person Mr. Bindukiran delivered a talk and conducted a quiz at the end. About 34 Students scored 20/20 marks. All the Winners were given a T-Shirt. Dr. Bhagyashree S R, Chairperson CICC and Women Cell Convened the event.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For more details click on <span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/SAKSHAM-2023.pdf\">Report</a></span></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
